  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "doc-6dbc22985a53fab1572ba5",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "全程无需刻意搜牌，靠每回合商店的自动刷新和锦囊牌寻找，锦囊牌优先2阶英雄兑换券，其次3阶英雄兑换券。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-41566fbed7f15e9d75a091d74c3f53b1cb8d0e2ceabc47cc7d8fe3491d66167d",
          "paragraph_start": 4,
          "paragraph_end": 4
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-cfabae0b265feb20835b2e",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "2阶英雄兑换券优先选芈月，其次梦奇，梦奇可以作为打出位触发姜导钦定主角提升主要输出英雄等级，兑换券同步触发芈月效果。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-41566fbed7f15e9d75a091d74c3f53b1cb8d0e2ceabc47cc7d8fe3491d66167d",
          "paragraph_start": 5,
          "paragraph_end": 5
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-234779f46a38aec9f37f15",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "开局只上一张孙膑，上场曜之后再合成孙膑至觉醒。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-41566fbed7f15e9d75a091d74c3f53b1cb8d0e2ceabc47cc7d8fe3491d66167d",
          "paragraph_start": 8,
          "paragraph_end": 8
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-5601e69106d683f045ec57",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "效果牌可以先攒着芈月上场后再使用，最大化等级加成。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-41566fbed7f15e9d75a091d74c3f53b1cb8d0e2ceabc47cc7d8fe3491d66167d",
          "paragraph_start": 9,
          "paragraph_end": 9
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-b2a37f3d8b519310af1e92",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "曜、孙膑过渡，觉醒孙膑，曜来得多也可以顺手觉醒，棋手卡一阶，自然升级，有孙膑就拿，持续叠等级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-41566fbed7f15e9d75a091d74c3f53b1cb8d0e2ceabc47cc7d8fe3491d66167d",
          "paragraph_start": 15,
          "paragraph_end": 15
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-f2caa129b10b057cddf7e5",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "第1轮拍卖：芈月 > 西施 > 猪八戒 > 老夫子 > 云中君 > 白起 > 梦奇",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-41566fbed7f15e9d75a091d74c3f53b1cb8d0e2ceabc47cc7d8fe3491d66167d",
          "paragraph_start": 16,
          "paragraph_end": 16
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-c7ac92245b96c8f57b2c0a",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "为了不浪费姜导的技能，每回合尽量打双数的英雄和效果牌。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-41566fbed7f15e9d75a091d74c3f53b1cb8d0e2ceabc47cc7d8fe3491d66167d",
          "paragraph_start": 7,
          "paragraph_end": 7
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-d71332c5bf7d251b7489c7",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "蒙犽使用技巧：血量健康时，先攒4张蒙犽，等到觉醒之后再使用唤醒之后卖掉，庄周同理。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-41566fbed7f15e9d75a091d74c3f53b1cb8d0e2ceabc47cc7d8fe3491d66167d",
          "paragraph_start": 10,
          "paragraph_end": 10
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-4d1c6fbf9f7357cb4c2582",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "老夫子和白起可以常驻场上，每回合刷战术牌，上阵庄周或老夫子产招募战术快速凑齐阵容，尽量在棋手3阶觉醒芈月，能量充足时升至4级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-41566fbed7f15e9d75a091d74c3f53b1cb8d0e2ceabc47cc7d8fe3491d66167d",
          "paragraph_start": 18,
          "paragraph_end": 18
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-a10f9cecb13eeb6fa594a3",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "第2轮拍卖：鲁班大师 > 蒙犽 > 庄周 > 太乙真人 > 杨玉环 > 甄姬（濒危时则太乙最优先，芈月未觉醒则杨玉环优先）",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-41566fbed7f15e9d75a091d74c3f53b1cb8d0e2ceabc47cc7d8fe3491d66167d",
          "paragraph_start": 19,
          "paragraph_end": 19
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-233a0973f43870ccb95b9d",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "3阶锦囊牌留意遗志，刷到遗志最后一轮拍卖可以选天降神兵，把孙膑的等级遗志给海月或其余强力五阶卡，如果没有遗志可以选择化铁为金。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-41566fbed7f15e9d75a091d74c3f53b1cb8d0e2ceabc47cc7d8fe3491d66167d",
          "paragraph_start": 6,
          "paragraph_end": 6
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-e4bd4b7abf4eba2074734b",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "能量充足时升至棋手5阶，可以购买鲁班大师，囤满4张决赛的时候上阵，傀儡机关能直接获得孙膑的等级。能量充足需要在11回合后升棋手6阶，追鲁班大师、太乙真人、白起觉醒。如果对手有强力单核阵容，如木兰、廉颇，手里可以留钟馗和杨玉环，在决赛用觉醒钟馗降低敌方单核等级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-41566fbed7f15e9d75a091d74c3f53b1cb8d0e2ceabc47cc7d8fe3491d66167d",
          "paragraph_start": 21,
          "paragraph_end": 21
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-1c734cc4e357236235a3a2",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "第3轮拍卖：扶摇直上 > 能量超新星 > 超级复印机 > 新生力量 > 四人同行（芈月未觉醒则优先拿妙音，压力大也可以用于觉醒太乙真人；濒危时选择绝处逢生和一线生机）",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-41566fbed7f15e9d75a091d74c3f53b1cb8d0e2ceabc47cc7d8fe3491d66167d",
          "paragraph_start": 22,
          "paragraph_end": 22
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-65e370a034e811586e9f01",
      "section": "推荐装备",
      "text": "孙膑装备推荐贤者之书、魔律之刃、痛苦面具，有西施可以减蓝量，法源之杯不是刚需，控制多带炽热/苍穹，用于替换痛苦面具/魔律之刃。特殊装备推荐噬神之书、机器头。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-41566fbed7f15e9d75a091d74c3f53b1cb8d0e2ceabc47cc7d8fe3491d66167d",
          "paragraph_start": 12,
          "paragraph_end": 12
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-a5a3d7f0386b3ded7fa434",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "材料已给出的棋手升级操作按前、中、后期执行；未明确各中间等阶的独立找牌目标、停留边界或六阶后资源安排时，仍待确认。升级前同时比较当前战力、掉血风险、核心与觉醒进度，以及升级后买牌预算；不能仅因到达某回合就忽略保命战力。",
      "version": null,
